  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal = 10000\n\nRate₁ = 10%\n\nRate₂ = 12.5%\n\nRate₃ = 8%\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nA = P × (1 + r₁ ÷ 100) × (1 + r₂ ÷ 100) × (1 + r₃ ÷ 100)\n\nInterest = A - P\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ A = 10000 × (1 + 10 ÷ 100) × (1 + 12.5 ÷ 100) × (1 + 8 ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ = 10000 × (11 ÷ 10) × (9 ÷ 8) × (27 ÷ 25)\n\n⇒ = 10000 × (2673 ÷ 2000)\n\n⇒ = 13365\n\n⇒ Interest = 13365 - 10000 = 3365\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 3365.**",
